== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added some graphics for the Nintendo Switch version of the game.

=== Changes ===
* {{e|Big Horn}} no longer has [[damage scaling]] (armor). If you stun him with a bomb, he still takes 20% more damage.
* {{i|Satanic Bible}} now correctly contributes towards the Bookworm transformation.
* {{i|Metronome}} is now a 2 charge item (up from 1 charge in the previous patch).
* It is no longer possible for {{i|Metronome}} to invoke {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}.
* The new Afterbirth+ shop was changed to make it symmetrical.
* HP changes:
** {{e|Rag Man}} 250 → 200.
** {{e|Rag Mega}} 110 → 120.
** {{e|Sisters Vis}} 500 → 350.
* Caves room #6 got completely nerfed.<ref>http://i.imgur.com/6YhVClu.png</ref>

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed the bug with {{i|The Ludovico Technique}} and {{i|Explosivo}} synergy where it wouldn't properly explode on enemies.
* Fixed the bug where if you saved and quit with {{t|Duct Tape}}, orbitals would not return to their proper position.
* Fixed the bug where if you save, quit, and continue in the middle of clearing a {{r|Challenge Room}}, the game would crash and/or the save file would get corrupted.
* Fixed the bug where on the {{e|Delirium}} fight, Gate would always spawn outside of the room.
* Fixed the bug with two {{i|Steam Sale}}s and an {{r|I AM ERROR}} room with purchasable items. (The second {{i|Steam Sale}} used to have no effect.) This was mentioned by Tyrone as fixed in the previous patch, but it was only actually fixed in this one.
* Fixed the difficulty on some {{s|Cathedral}} and {{s|Sheol}} rooms that were previously impossible to be generated by the floor generation algorithm. This was mentioned by Tyrone as fixed in the previous patch, but it was only actually fixed in this one.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Metronome}} would not work with health up items.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Metronome}} would erroneously give you the {{i|The Pinking Shears}} effect forever.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Metronome}} would erroneously keep the horns and speed up/down from {{i|Taurus}} forever.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|The Ludovico Technique}} and {{i|Sinus Infection}} synergy lead to a softlock situations with invincible enemies such as a Constant Stone Shooter.
* Fixed the bug with several [[library|libraries]] where they would never be generated by the floor generation algorithm. This was mentioned by Tyrone as fixed in the previous patch, but it was only actually fixed in this one.
* Fixed the bug with [https://i.imgur.com/jjc8210.png the new Afterbirth+ shop room] where it would never be generated by the floor generation algorithm. This was mentioned by Tyrone as fixed in the previous patch, but it was only actually fixed in this one.

== New bugs ==
* Taking two {{i|Steam Sale}}s would allow you to purchase items from a {{r|Devil Room}} and {{r|Black Market}} for free.
* Most Linux versions of the game crash on startup.

